@baseUrl = http://localhost:9001

# Protected endpoint — run "Login" from sessions/sessions.http first so the
# HTTP client stores and sends the session cookie automatically.

### Get current user  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/current_user
Accept: application/json

### Get current user — invalid session cookie (expects 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/current_user
Accept: application/json
Cookie: c3_session=invalid
